{"id":"n85822-1-15","stage":2,"title":"해소 · 解决","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85822-1-15-1","ko":"목이 말라서 주스 한 잔 마셔야겠다.","zh":"我口渴了，得喝杯果汁。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"목이","meaning":"喉咙，嗓子，咽喉","explanation":"목：喉咙，嗓子，咽喉；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"목","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89861","senseId":"2","lemma":"목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목이","audio":"/audio/12ba5841dcaa9b5a4d16.mp3"}},{"text":"말라서","meaning":"渴，口干","explanation":"마르다：渴，口干；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"마르다","audio":"/audio/6cd2f7184df80453aa2c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64677","senseId":"4","lemma":"마르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말라서","audio":"/audio/abaa86558a8e043d6e49.mp3"}},{"text":"주스","meaning":"汁，果汁","explanation":"주스：汁，果汁","readings":[{"term":"주스","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26899","senseId":"1","lemma":"주스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주스","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一（한 잔：一杯）","explanation":"한：一（한 잔：一杯）","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"잔","meaning":"杯","explanation":"잔：杯","readings":[{"term":"잔","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17371","senseId":"3","lemma":"잔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잔","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3"}},{"text":"마셔야겠다.","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마셔야겠다","audio":"/audio/82bf6ab1943aef260b1c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5fbc9add7bd4911b","term":"목","zh":"喉咙，嗓子，咽喉","audio":"/audio/5fbc9add7bd4911bb918.mp3","entryId":"89861","definition":"在脖子内部通向体内的深深的洞。","pronunciation":["목"]},{"id":"6cd2f7184df80453","term":"마르다","zh":"渴，口干","audio":"/audio/6cd2f7184df80453aa2c.mp3","entryId":"64677","definition":"嘴里或嗓子里唾液变少因而想喝水。","pronunciation":["마르다"]},{"id":"63db64644799c811","term":"주스","zh":"汁，果汁","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3","entryId":"26899","definition":"压榨水果或蔬菜而成的汁液；或指用它制成的饮料。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一（한 잔：一杯）","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一（한 잔：一杯）","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"ca06065856b9c29b","term":"잔","zh":"杯","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3","entryId":"17371","definition":"以盛饮料、酒等的器具为标准，数其数量的单位。","pronunciation":["잔"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3166dc60579a8b87a47.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85822-1-15-2","ko":"갈증 해소에는 주스보다 물이 더 좋아.","zh":"解渴的话，水比果汁更好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"갈증","meaning":"干渴，口渴","explanation":"갈증：干渴，口渴","readings":[{"term":"갈증","audio":"/audio/905165ff46ae43a8f9ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14864","senseId":"1","lemma":"갈증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈증","audio":"/audio/905165ff46ae43a8f9ed.mp3"}},{"text":"해소에는","meaning":"解决，消除","explanation":"해소：解决，消除；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"해소","audio":"/audio/bf1691edf12956aaa6b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85822","senseId":"1","lemma":"해소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해소에는","audio":"/audio/b8950b102deadb54724c.mp3"}},{"text":"주스보다","meaning":"汁，果汁","explanation":"주스：汁，果汁；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"주스","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26899","senseId":"1","lemma":"주스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주스보다","audio":"/audio/7b38a86de478e12e07ac.mp3"}},{"text":"물이","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물이","audio":"/audio/bbb693e9d07d2f260739.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"更好、更合适（解渴效果）","explanation":"좋다：更好、更合适（解渴效果）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"15","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"905165ff46ae43a8","term":"갈증","zh":"干渴，口渴","audio":"/audio/905165ff46ae43a8f9ed.mp3","entryId":"14864","definition":"嗓子干、想喝水的感觉。","pronunciation":["갈쯩"]},{"id":"bf1691edf12956aa","term":"해소","zh":"解决，消除","audio":"/audio/bf1691edf12956aaa6b5.mp3","entryId":"85822","definition":"解决困难的事或摆脱不好的状态。","pronunciation":["해ː소"]},{"id":"63db64644799c811","term":"주스","zh":"汁，果汁","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3","entryId":"26899","definition":"压榨水果或蔬菜而成的汁液；或指用它制成的饮料。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"更好、更合适（解渴效果）","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"更好、更合适（解渴效果）","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/bd49af9c24cc2ee069d4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.495,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=85822","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":84,"sequenceScore":2.3217,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["解渴的话，水比果汁更好。","敏俊，今天数学作业是什么？","我口渴了，得喝杯果汁。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["解渴的话，水比果汁更好。","我口渴了，得喝杯果汁。","敏俊，今天数学作业是什么？"],"answer":0}]}
